    "The US product page lists 7 1/2 by 1 3/4 by 13/16 inches, approximately 190.5 by 44.45 by 20.6375 mm, while both inspected manufacturer datasheet versions list 190 by 60 by 20 mm. They must not be silently averaged or treated as one exact jaw configuration.",
